  "title": "EquiFusion: Kinematics-Agnostic Human Motion Prediction via Equivariant Latent Diffusion",
  "summary": "EquiFusion introduces a kinematics-agnostic model to solve the limitations of existing stochastic 3D human motion prediction, enabling cross-dataset generalization and zero-shot motion prediction. It achieves state-of-the-art results on major benchmarks while being more compact and efficient than previous kinematics-specific methods.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "EquiFusion treats kinematics' connectivity as an explicit input parameter, ensuring its internal computations are agnostic to joint ordering and graph structure.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "It achieves up to 75% more compact performance than previous kinematics-specific methods, with faster training and inference.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
  ],
